{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2022-03-07 12:30:00', 'title': 'POTOMAC EDISON INSTALLS FOUR NEW EV FAST-CHARGING STATIONS IN MARYLAND', 'text': 'WILLIAMSPORT, MD., MARCH 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0POTOMAC EDISON, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), HAS COMPLETED THE INSTALLATION OF FOUR NEW ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) FAST-CHARGING STATIONS IN FROSTBURG AND FRIENDSVILLE, EXPANDING ITS NETWORK OF PUBLICLY AVAILABLE STATIONS IN MARYLAND.'}